**/target/

# Build artifacts under tests/fixtures.
#
# Compiling a fixture writes its output next to the source: `cargo run --
# tests/fixtures/x.cnb` leaves an extensionless `x` binary beside `x.cnb`,
# and `--emit-llvm` leaves an `x.ll`. `pre_commit_check.sh` deletes the
# specific ones it builds, but anything compiled by hand while working
# stays behind and is easy to commit by accident.
#
# This is an allowlist rather than a list of artifact patterns, because a
# compiled fixture has no extension to match on. Only fixture *sources* are
# trackable; everything else under this tree is a local build product. A new
# source kind needs its extension added here (or a one-off `git add -f`).
tests/fixtures/**
!tests/fixtures/**/
!tests/fixtures/**/*.cnb
!tests/fixtures/**/*.idl

# Local Netlify folder
.netlify
